Hi there,

two small things:

In the sendmail.cf you should make the following adaptations:
    - DMdomain.com     (this will masq all mail as @domain.com and not
@server.domain.com)
    - Cwdomain.com (This will tell the system which domains are viewed as local
so no MX lookup will be done for these domains)

Second
    Your DNS part only shows 1 A record pop infact the A record
server.domain.com should be in there too. An MX record always points  to a
A record.

If you need more indepth views on configuring SMTP drop by at my
sode: http://www.phonax.com

Raymond

