system <wongpk@starhub.net.sg> wrote:

>I have run the CE security setyo, secsetup.
>However I need to duplicate all this user accounts from machine A to anothoer Machine B.
>What are the files, shoudl I copy from Host A to Host B.

On HOST B run secsetup.

On HOST A run "edauth -g > /tmp/auth.data" and copy to host B.   Copy
/etc/passwd and /etc/group from Host A to HOST B.

On HOST B run "cat /tmp/auth.data | edauth -s -C"  (Omit the -C if you
don't want to overwrite existing passwd entries.

keith



