The CD will only help you if you run version 4.0x of Tru64. 
setld will deny installation on a 5.0 workstation. 
For 5.0, the client side support is bundled into the hardware 
acceleration (driver) software. For the Elsa, there seems to be no
hardware specific extension to the X-server, so you just get any 
more or less approriate of the tar files distributed on 

http://www.support.compaq.com/open3d

and install everything but the hardware acceleration. 

